cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below (preferred). The software has its own metadata at the top level."
title: "vr-fraudnet-reproduction: a companion implementation of VR-FraudNet"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/parthachk64-cyber/vr-fraudnet-reproduction"
abstract: >-
  Independently written Python implementation of the five-stage VR-FraudNet pipeline
  (spectral encoder, focal LightGBM triage, schema-constrained rationale model, deterministic
  verifier, isotonic mixer with split-conformal sets), with data adapters, baselines, table
  builders and a mathematical audit of the published article. Not the authors' code.
